  "properties": {
    "long_instructions": "# Wrap Up\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; background: #f7f8fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto;\">\r\n\r\n  <div>\r\n    <h4 style=\"margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">In this professional learning module, you learned to:</h4>\r\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 10px; font-size: 14pt\">\r\n      <li>Identify and analyze ethical issues in AI—including misinformation, bias, and data privacy—and explain how they impact classroom use.\r\n</li><br>\r\n\t  <li>Apply strategies to recognize and respond to AI-generated misinformation and biased outputs.\r\n</li><br>\r\n      <li>Model and implement responsible AI practices in your classroom, including guiding students in ethical use and data privacy awareness.</li><br>\r\n      <li>Evaluate AI tools for safe and appropriate use by applying key considerations such as privacy, transparency, and educational alignment.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div>\r\n    <img src=\"https://images.code.org/89644a0804bcdfc2839b17f70bcef23c-Screenshot 2025-12-04 at 2.33.30 PM.png\" \r\n         alt=\"Icon with computer and weblayout\" \r\n         style=\"border-radius: 10px; width: 200px; height: auto;\">\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n## Closing Reflection\r\n\r\n> #### In the reflection box below, answer **one or more** of the following questions:\r\n> #### &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp 1. What's one piece of information you will never put into an AI tool to protect you or your student's data privacy?\r\n> #### &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp 2. What's one guiding principle you can use when reviewing prompts for misinformation and/or bias?\r\n> #### &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp 3. A teacher sees you using AI to help lesson plan and asks how you can trust AI when it's always making things up. How do you respond?\r\n",
